<p>The Milan-Cortina Winter Paralympics ended in Cortina d&#x27;Ampezzo on Sunday with a closing ceremony that organizers described as a message of unity, even as Ukraine boycotted the event to protest Russia&#x27;s return to the Games. The ceremony also included the handover of the Paralympic flag to organizers of the next Winter Paralympics in the French Alps. On the field of play, China finished atop the medal table. That left the Games ending on two notes at once: celebration and a look ahead to the next host, alongside clear political tension over athlete participation and ceremony attendance.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/sl35huRkD9i2lsmgrA5mdlgXI98llgGAOcOq-5Y_7teNm2vyeKTAoARAcg0pfPvQiHI_-pNODNV_TRNhCUAeSlED9QaXu9nLNYFiMpEpKbF2yZDd1j2lVApztm3Pv6V_XC6GBc5heS5mqqXkpwoA9t58GuYI6xQsEeE9T3AgEYSVBlg501Zj-82oT-w9oVk-LW1zTnFELjkEOxVUSLaWS9oCrOhIBs_SRimOFwG2bw0PdOQPGCXqpIiRTf7fGFng56xW7Sw' alt='Athletes of Italy carry out the Italian flag before the rendition of the national anthem during the closing ceremony, Milano Cortina 2026 Paralympics, Cortina Curling Olympic Stadium, Cortina d&#x27;Ampezzo, Italy, March 15, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Ukraine: Ukraine skipped both the opening and closing ceremonies to protest the presence of Russian athletes at the Paralympics. (<a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/milan-cortina-paralympics-end-with-boycott-by-ukraine-at-games-marked-by-russias-return'>PBS NewsHour</a>)</li><li>Paralympic organizers: Organizers described the closing ceremony as a &#x27;beacon of unity&#x27; despite the dispute over Russia&#x27;s return. (<a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/16/milan-cortina-paralympics-end-as-a-beacon-of-unity_6751479_4.html'>Le Monde</a>)</li><li>French Alps 2030 organizers: Reports said the next Winter Paralympics in the French Alps will use the same dispersed hosting model as Milan-Cortina. (<a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/16/milan-cortina-paralympics-end-as-a-beacon-of-unity_6751479_4.html'>Le Monde</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/milan-cortina-paralympics-end-with-boycott-by-ukraine-at-games-marked-by-russias-return'>Milan Cortina Paralympics end with boycott by Ukraine at Games marked by Russia&#x27;s return</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/03/16/milan-cortina-paralympics-end-as-a-beacon-of-unity_6751479_4.html'>Milan-Cortina Paralympics end as a &#x27;beacon of unity&#x27;</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.france24.com/en/live-news/20260315-milan-cortina-paralympics-end-as-a-beacon-of-unity'>The Winter Paralympics conclude in Cortina d&#x27;Ampezzo, Italy, with China as the highest-ranked team in the medal table. The Paralympic flag is handed over to the organizers of the 2030 Winter Paralympics to be held in the French Alps.</a> - france24.com</li></ul>